From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:37:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] Add bilingual subtitle settings screen with provider
 config and style editor

- New BisubSettingsFragment registered in SettingsResourceRegistry and
  linked from main_settings (language pair, LLM provider/API key/model,
  batch/budget parameters)
- In-app style editor dialog (dialog_bisub_style.xml) with a live
  true-ratio BisubSubtitleView preview on a neutral gradient
  background; single 'subtitle size' slider plus text color,
  background mode, padding, corner radius, max width and vertical
  position
- All bisub string resources for values and values-zh-rCN
